    {
      "v": 5,
      "zh": "于是定了命令，传遍以色列，从别是巴直到但，使他们都来，在耶路撒冷向耶和华―以色列的　神守逾越节；因为照所写的例，守这节的不多了（或译：因为民许久没有照所写的例守节了）。",
      "en": "So they sent an edict[NOTE:1] throughout Israel from Beer Sheba to Dan, summoning the people[NOTE:2] to come and observe a Passover for the Lord God of Israel in Jerusalem, for they had not observed it on a nationwide scale as prescribed in the law.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “and they caused to stand a word to cause a voice to pass through.”",
