      "zh": "驿卒就把王和众首领的信，遵着王命传遍以色列和犹大。信内说：「以色列人哪，你们当转向耶和华―亚伯拉罕、以撒、以色列的　神，好叫他转向你们这脱离亚述王手的余民。",
      "en": "Messengers[NOTE:1] delivered the letters from the king and his officials throughout Israel and Judah. This royal edict read:[NOTE:2] “O Israelites, return to the Lord God of Abraham, Isaac, and Israel, so he may return[NOTE:3] to you who have been spared from the kings of Assyria.[NOTE:4]",
