    {
      "v": 8,
      "zh": "现在不要像你们列祖硬着颈项，只要归顺耶和华，进入他的圣所，就是永远成圣的居所；又要事奉耶和华―你们的　神，好使他的烈怒转离你们。",
      "en": "Now, don’t be stubborn[NOTE:1] like your fathers. Submit[NOTE:2] to the Lord and come to his sanctuary which he has permanently consecrated. Serve the Lord your God so that he might relent from his raging anger.[NOTE:3]",
